Z||000000||Formula||06-19-2001||11:25 PM||||the bottom end is almost completly built, all I have to do now is a valve lash, intake (edelbrock 60 deg. thruster 2) put the valve pans on and get a new cradle and put it in there!<P>btw, the holes are really easy to drill if you put oil on the bits lol..<P><BR>and for those who didnt know, its a 270 hp, 3.4 out of a camaro originally, then it was put into a blazer that could do a 6 inch wheelie!<P>I'm a bit skeptical of the 270 hp though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>also, heads are ported, polished, shaved to I believe 11:1 compression, intake is ported, it has a huge cam in it, high volume oil pump and a windage tray, holley 390 carb, I'll give details about the actual valves, cam, etc.. specs when I get them.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigformulagt.jpg"> ||||reg||1
